<p>Nepal is set to swear in Balendra Shah, a 35-year-old former rapper widely known as Balen, as its new prime minister after an election victory that will make him the country’s youngest leader. Shah’s first message after the election came as a rap rather than a formal speech. His rise follows the political upheaval of the past year.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Uxhwlk5ElwHaRlg_kG4BxwSFfk-eLw1rYo4a2o-hKAStzYDuEL-ybJ7s7boaDFHlNTDN9cuY5DfDNInUv47YS1nX_EPjzORtGcBAAHZR2-m7rI8k7aTtzgsA-LfYeS43JRSSsVNgsNSVEaxHmltySM5X_RuPPUjsNt39rsMovg' alt='Balendra Shah ahead of his swearing-in as Nepal’s new prime minister' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Internet response: NDTV said Shah’s rap message took the internet by storm, giving his first outreach after the election unusual reach beyond formal politics.</li><li>Lawmaker oath: Before becoming prime minister, Shah swore an oath as a newly elected lawmaker, according to The Guardian.</li><li>Change mandate: The BBC said Shah won by a landslide after promising change to voters angry about corruption, underscoring both the scale of his victory and the message behind it.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Balendra Shah: By using his first post-election message to call for unity, Shah signaled that he may bring his nontraditional public style into high office rather than quickly shifting to standard political messaging. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/26/nepal-pm-balendra-shah-rap'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Younger voters: Coverage suggests many younger Nepalis backed Shah as a break from a political class they associated with corruption and the turmoil of the past year. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c895v335xkgo'>BBC</a>, <a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/26/nepal-pm-balendra-shah-rap'>The Guardian</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/26/nepal-pm-balendra-shah-rap'>Nepal’s PM-to-be uses rap to call for unity in first post-election message</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/nepal-prime-minister-balen-shahs-1st-post-election-message-isnt-a-speech-its-a-rap-11272886#publisher=newsstand'>To Be Nepal PM Balen Shah Raps In First Post-Election Message</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/nepals-new-prime-minister-chooses-auspicious-time-oath-131461117'>Nepal&#x27;s new prime minister chooses auspicious time to take oath of office</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c895v335xkgo'>Nepal to swear in ex-rapper as new prime minister</a> - bbc.com</li></ul>